{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Oracle harness correction before production code: the signed plan named tests/unit/test_reclaim_bridge_history.py and tests/integration/test_reclaim_bridge_history.py, but this repository collects non-package tests by basename, so those two files cause a Pytest import-file-mismatch collection error. Renamed only the unit oracle to tests/unit/test_reclaim_bridge_history_stream.py; behavior, tier, AC mapping, and integration filename are unchanged. The proving command is now pytest tests/unit/test_reclaim_bridge_history_stream.py tests/integration/test_reclaim_bridge_history.py -v. This is a collection-path correction, not an implementation or contract change."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785842660727221001,"uuid":"f601ad99-cccf-48ad-8efe-f20a1422a6f8"}